's magic, while Tyra receives an unexpected visitor and Matt and Landry find life harder than expected.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s2e1.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":2,"e":2,"n":"Bad Ideas","r":43,"y":"The first day of school brings big changes at Dillon High, Matt watches his world wobble, and Tami adjusts to caring for both a newborn and a teenager.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s2e2.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":2,"e":3,"n":"Are You Ready for Friday Night?","r":43,"y":"Matt and Smash bristle under the new coach as the season opener approaches, and Eric visits home to see how the Panthers are faring without him.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s2e3.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":2,"e":4,"n":"Backfire","r":43,"y":"Tim joins Jason on a trip to Mexico seeking experimental surgery, Lyla helps a newcomer settle in, and Coach Taylor weighs a major career decision.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s2e4.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":2,"e":5,"n":"Let's Get It On","r":44,"y":"Coach Taylor returns to Dillon to a complicated welcome, friction grows between Matt and Smash, and Riggins enlists Lyla to change Jason's mind about surgery.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s2e5.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":2,"e":6,"n":"How Did I Get Here?","r":44,"y":"Landry grows anxious about a police investigation, Tami's sister arrives to help with the baby, and Riggins must prove his commitment to Coach Taylor.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s2e6.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":2,"e":7,"n":"Pantherama!","r":43,"y":"College scouts court Smash ahead of a big decision, Lyla and Tyra organize the annual Pantherama, and Matt enjoys life with his new cheerleader girlfriend.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s2e7.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":2,"e":8,"n":"Seeing Other People","r":43,"y":"Smash heads out on his first recruiting visit, and Matt proposes an open relationship to his cheerleader girlfriend.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s2e8.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":2,"e":9,"n":"The Confession","r":43,"y":"Landry wrestles with his conscience, Jason tries an online dating service, and the Taylors prepare for Gracie's christening amid friction between Tami and Julie.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s2e9.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":2,"e":10,"n":"There Goes the Neighborhood","r":43,"y":"A tornado damages rival Laribee High, forcing both schools to share Dillon's facilities, while Tim moves into the Taylor home and tension builds between Landry and Tyra.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s2e10.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":2,"e":11,"n":"Jumping the Gun","r":43,"y":"Major colleges press Smash for a verbal commitment, tension lingers between Coach Taylor and Tim, and the Panthers prepare for an important game.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s2e11.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":2,"e":12,"n":"Who Do You Think You Are?","r":43,"y":"The Taylors struggle to choose day care for Gracie, Lyla becomes a Christian radio host, and Matt Saracen makes a discovery about his family.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s2e12.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":2,"e":13,"n":"Humble Pie","r":43,"y":"Coach Taylor brings Tami on to coach girls' volleyball with Tyra's help, and Smash finds himself in a confrontation at a movie theater that creates a serious dilemma.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s2e13.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":2,"e":14,"n":"Leave No One Behind","r":43,"y":"Matt hits rock bottom, Tami's bond with Tyra makes Julie jealous, Landry gains an admirer, and Smash turns to Coach Taylor for advice.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s2e14.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":2,"e":15,"n":"May the Best Man Win","r":43,"y":"Smash's pursuit of a college scholarship takes a new turn, Tami runs into an old flame who sparks Eric's jealousy, and Jason receives a life-changing opportunity.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s2e15.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":3,"e":1,"n":"I Knew You When","r":47,"y":"Coach Taylor fights to hold onto his job while helping Smash recover, Tami starts her new role as principal, and Tyra worries about her college prospects.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s3e1.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":3,"e":2,"n":"Tami Knows Best","r":43,"y":"Tami is upset with Tyra's choices, Matt tracks down his estranged mother while caring for his grandmother, and Coach Taylor encourages Smash at college tryouts.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s3e2.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":3,"e":3,"n":"How the Other Half Lives","r":43,"y":"Coach worries about his job as Tami befriends a booster's wife, a talented freshman quarterback raises the pressure on Matt, and Billy pulls Tim into a risky scheme.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s3e3.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":3,"e":4,"n":"Hello, Goodbye","r":43,"y":"Tami stumbles in front of the superintendent, Tyra is drawn to a cowboy drifter, Matt struggles with his returning mother, and Smash says goodbye to Coach.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s3e4.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":3,"e":5,"n":"Every Rose Has Its Thorn","r":43,"y":"Matt wrestles with his mother and his place on the team, Tami worries about Julie's friendship with Tyra, and Jason faces disappointment in his personal life.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s3e5.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":3,"e":6,"n":"It Ain't Easy Being J.D. McCoy","r":43,"y":"A hazing incident angers Coach Taylor, the freshman quarterback wins over the town, and Julie and Matt share a memorable night by the lake.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s3e6.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":3,"e":7,"n":"Keeping Up Appearances","r":43,"y":"Eric and Tami try to calm angry parents, Billy helps Tim chase a college scholarship, and Jason, Herc and the Riggins brothers receive good news.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s3e7.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":3,"e":8,"n":"New York, New York","r":43,"y":"Tim worries when Jason talks about leaving Dillon, money troubles cause friction between Tami and Eric, and Julie raises Matt's idea with her father.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s3e8.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":3,"e":9,"n":"Game of the Week","r":43,"y":"Tim comes home to mixed surprises, Coach reluctantly backs Tami as she helps Tyra, Matt clashes with his mother, and Lyla and Mindy team up.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s3e9.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":3,"e":10,"n":"The Giving Tree","r":43,"y":"The young quarterback ignores his father's advice, Lyla turns to Riggins after a revelation from Buddy, and Tyra tries to repair things with Landry.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s3e10.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":3,"e":11,"n":"A Hard Rain's Gonna Fall","r":43,"y":"Tyra leans on Landry once again, the Taylors learn of a change that could split up the Panthers, and Matt panics when his grandmother has an accident.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s3e11.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":3,"e":12,"n":"Underdogs","r":43,"y":"Family tensions spill into the open for the young quarterback, Tyra pushes hard for college, and Matt and Tim prepare for their final high school game.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s3e12.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":3,"e":13,"n":"Tomorrow Blues","r":45,"y":"Months later, Coach Taylor's contract comes up for review on Billy and Mindy's wedding day, while Matt and Tim face big decisions about their futures.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s3e13.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":4,"e":1,"n":"East of Dillon","r":43,"y":"Coach Taylor faces the daunting task of building a team at the newly reopened East Dillon High, while Tami navigates politics at West Dillon and Matt tries townie life.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s4e1.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":4,"e":2,"n":"After the Fall","r":44,"y":"A controversy sends a talented player to the East Dillon Lions, Coach works to lift his discouraged squad, and Tim finds an unexpected new place to live.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s4e2.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":4,"e":3,"n":"In the Skin of a Lion","r":43,"y":"Coach makes a financial decision that strains Tami's trust, a rivalry between two players hurts the team, and Tim helps condition the Lions.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s4e3.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":4,"e":4,"n":"A Sort of Homecoming","r":43,"y":"Homecoming prompts Coach to dig into East Dillon's history, Tami weathers the anger of boosters, and Landry and Vince both take an interest in Jess.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s4e4.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":4,"e":5,"n":"The Son","r":45,"y":"Friends and family gather around Matt during a painful time, Vince risks his future to support his family, and Becky and Tim grow closer.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s4e5.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":4,"e":6,"n":"Stay","r":43,"y":"Coach searches for a plan against a formidable opponent, Tim reconnects with Lyla, Vince gets drawn into car theft, and Julie and Matt take a trip to Austin.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s4e6.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":4,"e":7,"n":"In the Bag","r":43,"y":"Coach turns to Vince at quarterback despite some doubts, Tami tries to console a heartbroken Julie, and Tim has a run-in with Becky's father.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s4e7.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":4,"e":8,"n":"Toilet Bowl","r":43,"y":"Coach realizes the Lions' troubles extend beyond the field, Jess must choose between two suitors, and Riggins makes a decision that could backfire.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s4e8.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":4,"e":9,"n":"The Lights in Carroll Park","r":43,"y":"Coach takes a stand against drugs and gang violence in a neighborhood park, Becky faces an unexpected situation, and Julie makes a new friend.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s4e9.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":4,"e":10,"n":"I Can't","r":43,"y":"Riggins puts Tami in a difficult position, Vince's mother has a health scare, Luke's parents try to support him, and Eric is pushed to adjust his coaching style.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s4e10.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":4,"e":11,"n":"Injury List","r":43,"y":"The Lions struggle to concentrate on their next game, Tami gets caught in a controversy, Vince wants out of a deal, and Julie receives a surprise phone call.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s4e11.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":4,"e":12,"n":"Laboring","r":43,"y":"Tension builds across town as the Lions prepare to face the Panthers, Coach benches Luke, and Vince seeks payback alongside a dangerous ally.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s4e12.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":4,"e":13,"n":"Thanksgiving","r":45,"y":"The Taylors host a Thanksgiving dinner, Coach pushes Vince to play more selfishly, Julie and Landry get a visitor from the past, and Tim faces a hard choice.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s4e13.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":5,"e":1,"n":"Expectations","r":43,"y":"Coach Taylor manages lofty expectations for the new season, Vince and Luke try to recruit a new teammate, and Dillon says goodbye to two students heading to college.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s5e1.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":5,"e":2,"n":"On the Outside Looking In","r":43,"y":"Not everyone is satisfied after the Lions' season opener, Vince enjoys the perks of football fame, and Luke's aggressive play brings consequences.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s5e2.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":5,"e":3,"n":"The Right Hand of the Father","r":43,"y":"A figure from Vince's past returns, Julie connects with someone at college, Eric tries to instill discipline, and Buddy learns something troubling about his son.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s5e3.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":5,"e":4,"n":"Keep Looking","r":43,"y":"Coach mediates a locker room conflict, Luke draws recruiting interest, Tami works with a struggling student, and the Lions welcome a newcomer to the team.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s5e4.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":5,"e":5,"n":"Kingdom","r":43,"y":"Coach reviews the rules of recruiting, the Lions hit the road for a game, the team's top players make a pact, and Julie's love life grows complicated.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s5e5.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":5,"e":6,"n":"Swerve","r":43,"y":"A magazine profile hails Coach Taylor as a kingmaker, Vince's past catches up with him, and Julie's return to college is delayed.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s5e6.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":5,"e":7,"n":"Perfect Record","r":43,"y":"Rivalry week brings controversy, Vince is caught between Coach and his father, and Billy takes Luke under his wing.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s5e7.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":5,"e":8,"n":"Fracture","r":43,"y":"Coach fears he is losing control of his team, Tami worries about a neglected student, Vince alienates his teammates, and Becky enters a beauty pageant.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s5e8.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":5,"e":9,"n":"Gut Check","r":43,"y":"Coach considers suspending Vince, Luke feels the pressure mounting, Billy hears surprising news from Mindy, and Becky starts a new job.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s5e9.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":5,"e":10,"n":"Don't Go","r":43,"y":"A powerhouse college program tries to lure Coach away, Vince works to earn back his position, and friends speak on Tim's behalf at a parole hearing.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s5e10.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":5,"e":11,"n":"The March","r":43,"y":"Budget cuts threaten East Dillon athletics, Tami travels to Pennsylvania for a rare opportunity, and the Lions begin their run toward the state title.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s5e11.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":5,"e":12,"n":"Texas Whatever","r":43,"y":"Coach Taylor receives a tempting offer, Tim reconsiders his plans when an old flame returns to town, and the future of East Dillon football is decided.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s5e12.jpg"},{"t":"friday-night-lights","s":5,"e":13,"n":"Always","r":62,"y":"In the series finale, the Lions prepare for the state championship while the Taylors face choices that could reshape their family's future.","p":"/assets/stills/friday-night-lights-s5e13.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":1,"e":1,"n":"Pilot","r":72,"y":"Three years after two percent of the world's population inexplicably vanished, police chief Kevin Garvey tries to keep the peace in Mapleton as the town plans a memorial.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s1e1.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":1,"e":2,"n":"Penguin One, Us Zero","r":57,"y":"Kevin seeks help from a therapist after a series of unsettling events, while his son Tom guards a young woman tied to a mysterious spiritual leader.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s1e2.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":1,"e":3,"n":"Two Boats and a Helicopter","r":53,"y":"Reverend Matt Jamison crusades against the idea that the Departed were saints, while struggling to save his church from losing its building.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s1e3.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":1,"e":4,"n":"B.J. and the A.C.","r":51,"y":"A missing holiday decoration sends Kevin on a frustrating search, Tom faces danger on the road, and the Guilty Remnant cult makes a provocative public move.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s1e4.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":1,"e":5,"n":"Gladys","r":56,"y":"A shocking act of violence tests Laurie's commitment to the Guilty Remnant, while Kevin's efforts to keep Mapleton calm continue to fall short.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s1e5.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":1,"e":6,"n":"Guest","r":52,"y":"Nora travels to New York for a convention about the Departure, where a mix-up with her badge sends her through a series of strange encounters.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s1e6.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":1,"e":7,"n":"Solace for Tired Feet","r":58,"y":"Kevin searches for his father after he leaves a psychiatric facility, Jill attempts to set an endurance record, and Tom makes a disturbing discovery.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s1e7.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":1,"e":8,"n":"Cairo","r":56,"y":"Kevin finds himself in a bewildering situation with Guilty Remnant leader Patti Levin, while tensions flare among Meg, Matt, Jill and Nora.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s1e8.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":1,"e":9,"n":"The Garveys at Their Best","r":56,"y":"A look back at the time before the Departure finds Kevin chasing a destructive deer around Mapleton while quiet tensions simmer within the Garvey family.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s1e9.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":1,"e":10,"n":"The Prodigal Son Returns","r":54,"y":"Kevin finds help in an unlikely place while the Guilty Remnant launches an elaborate plan for Memorial Day in the season one finale.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s1e10.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":2,"e":1,"n":"Axis Mundi","r":62,"y":"In the Texas town of Jarden, nicknamed Miracle because nobody there vanished, the Murphy family goes about life in a place outsiders believe is protected.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s2e1.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":2,"e":2,"n":"A Matter of Geography","r":57,"y":"Kevin, Nora and Jill try to leave the past behind by moving to Miracle, but old troubles follow them as they become entangled with their new neighbors.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s2e2.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":2,"e":3,"n":"Off Ramp","r":57,"y":"Laurie and Tom try to rescue people from the Guilty Remnant, but their mission takes a personal toll as they uncover new problems within the cult.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s2e3.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":2,"e":4,"n":"Orange Sticker","r":55,"y":"After an earthquake, Nora discovers Kevin missing, while the Murphys face a crisis and Kevin struggles to account for the previous night.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s2e4.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":2,"e":5,"n":"No Room at the Inn","r":57,"y":"Matt takes his wife Mary outside Miracle seeking answers about her condition, only to find himself barred from returning to town.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s2e5.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":2,"e":6,"n":"Lens","r":58,"y":"Unexpected visitors unsettle Nora and leave her wrestling with a nagging question about herself, while Kevin's troubles grow impossible to ignore.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s2e6.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":2,"e":7,"n":"A Most Powerful Adversary","r":58,"y":"Nora shares surprising news with Kevin and Jill, Laurie makes an impulsive choice that affects the Garveys, and Kevin considers how to deal with Patti.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s2e7.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":2,"e":8,"n":"International Assassin","r":63,"y":"After taking desperate action to rid himself of Patti, Kevin finds himself navigating a strange and surreal landscape.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s2e8.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":2,"e":9,"n":"Ten Thirteen","r":55,"y":"A personal loss and a journey to Miracle shed light on how Meg became a fierce Guilty Remnant crusader, while Tom tries to reconnect with her.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s2e9.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":2,"e":10,"n":"I Live Here Now","r":73,"y":"Kevin opens up to John about his connection to recent events as Miracle faces a threat on the anniversary of the Departure in the season two finale.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s2e10.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":3,"e":1,"n":"The Book of Kevin","r":61,"y":"Years after the chaos in Miracle, Kevin is back on the job as police chief as the seventh anniversary of the Departure draws near.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s3e1.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":3,"e":2,"n":"Don't Be Ridiculous","r":59,"y":"Working as an investigator for the Department of Sudden Departure, Nora travels to St. Louis to look into a scheme targeting families of the Departed.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s3e2.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":3,"e":3,"n":"Crazy Whitefella Thinking","r":58,"y":"Kevin Garvey Sr. roams the Australian Outback, guided by a vision he believes could prevent a looming catastrophe.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s3e3.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":3,"e":4,"n":"G'Day Melbourne","r":56,"y":"Kevin and Nora travel to Australia, where she pursues the masterminds behind a scam while he glimpses a face from his past.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s3e4.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":3,"e":5,"n":"It's a Matt, Matt, Matt, Matt World","r":56,"y":"Convinced Kevin must be in Miracle for the anniversary, Matt Jamison heads to Australia to bring him home, but his journey takes unexpected turns.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s3e5.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":3,"e":6,"n":"Certified","r":59,"y":"Laurie Garvey returns to her work as a therapist as she travels to Australia to help Nora and Kevin find their way.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s3e6.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":3,"e":7,"n":"The Most Powerful Man in the World (and His Identical Twin Brother)","r":61,"y":"Kevin takes on another identity as he undertakes a mission he hopes will help others.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s3e7.jpg"},{"t":"the-leftovers","s":3,"e":8,"n":"The Book of Nora","r":73,"y":"In the series finale, the story of Nora Durst comes into focus as long-standing questions about loss and belief come to a head.","p":"/assets/stills/the-leftovers-s3e8.jpg"},{"t":"band-of-brothers","s":1,"e":1,"n":"Currahee","r":74,"y":"The paratroopers of Easy Company endure grueling training under a harsh commander whose methods put him at odds with his men, including Richard Winters.","p":"/assets/stills/band-of-brothers-s1e1.jpg"},{"t":"band-of-brothers","s":1,"e":2,"n":"Day of Days","r":52,"y":"Scattered across the Normandy countryside on D-Day, Easy Company's paratroopers regroup as Lieutenant Winters is thrust into leading the men under fire.","p":"/assets/stills/band-of-brothers-s1e2.jpg"},{"t":"band-of-brothers","s":1,"e":3,"n":"Carentan","r":66,"y":"Easy Company fights to take the French town of Carentan, as Private Albert Blithe struggles with the psychological toll of combat.","p":"/assets/stills/band-of-brothers-s1e3.jpg"},{"t":"band-of-brothers","s":1,"e":4,"n":"Replacements","r":60,"y":"Bolstered by new replacements, Easy Company drops into Holland as part of Operation Market Garden and runs into fierce German resistance.","p":"/assets/stills/band-of-brothers-s1e4.jpg"},{"t":"band-of-brothers","s":1,"e":5,"n":"Crossroads","r":56,"y":"Winters recounts a fierce engagement in Holland while wrestling with its weight on his conscience, before Easy Company is rushed toward Bastogne.","p":"/assets/stills/band-of-brothers-s1e5.jpg"},{"t":"band-of-brothers","s":1,"e":6,"n":"Bastogne","r":68,"y":"Surrounded in the frozen forests outside Bastogne, Easy Company holds the line short on supplies as medic Eugene Roe tends to the wounded.","p":"/assets/stills/band-of-brothers-s1e6.jpg"},{"t":"band-of-brothers","s":1,"e":7,"n":"The Breaking Point","r":73,"y":"First Sergeant Carwood Lipton narrates as Easy Company endures the brutal fighting near Foy, Belgium, and questions mount about its leadership.","p":"/assets/stills/band-of-brothers-s1e7.jpg"},{"t":"band-of-brothers","s":1,"e":8,"n":"The Last Patrol","r":59,"y":"In Hagenau in early 1945, Easy Company prepares a risky night patrol across a river to capture German prisoners for interrogation.","p":"/assets/stills/band-of-brothers-s1e8.jpg"},{"t":"band-of-brothers","s":1,"e":9,"n":"Why We Fight","r":59,"y":"As Easy Company advances into Germany near the end of the war, weary soldiers grapple with growing disillusionment and an unsettling discovery in the forest.","p":"/assets/stills/band-of-brothers-s1e9.jpg"},{"t":"band-of-brothers","s":1,"e":10,"n":"Points","r":63,"y":"As the war in Europe winds down, Easy Company is stationed in Austria, where the men wonder who will be sent on to fight in the Pacific.","p":"/assets/stills/band-of-brothers-s1e10.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":1,"e":1,"n":"Pilot","r":70,"y":"In early-1980s suburban Washington, two KGB sleeper agents posing as an ordinary married couple find their cover tested when an FBI counterintelligence agent moves in next door.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s1e1.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":1,"e":2,"n":"The Clock","r":48,"y":"The Jennings must get a listening device into the Defense Secretary's study, and their plan hinges on pressuring a reluctant housekeeper who wants nothing to do with them.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s1e2.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":1,"e":3,"n":"Gregory","r":46,"y":"A fallen comrade turns out to have had a secret spouse, and Philip and Elizabeth must gauge her loyalties while the FBI's inquiry edges closer to them.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s1e3.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":1,"e":4,"n":"In Control","r":43,"y":"The shooting of President Reagan throws Soviet intelligence into confusion, leaving the Jennings unsure of their orders as Stan leans hard on his Soviet informant for answers.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s1e4.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":1,"e":5,"n":"COMINT","r":40,"y":"An emotionally fragile asset endangers an entire spy network just as the couple is assigned to crack a new FBI encrypted communications system.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s1e5.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":1,"e":6,"n":"Trust Me","r":50,"y":"Suspicion of a traitor inside the KGB spreads paranoia among the operatives and deepens the rift in the Jennings' marriage, while Stan scrambles to protect his informant.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s1e6.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":1,"e":7,"n":"Duty and Honor","r":41,"y":"An assignment to undermine a Polish dissident brings Philip face to face with a woman from his past, adding fresh strain to an already fragile marriage.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s1e7.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":1,"e":8,"n":"Mutually Assured Destruction","r":48,"y":"A Soviet hit man is targeting American scientists, and the Jennings race to stop him while Stan's FBI team hunts the same man from the other side.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s1e8.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":1,"e":9,"n":"Safe House","r":49,"y":"What should be an ordinary operation spirals out of control for Philip and Elizabeth, while the FBI is shaken when one of its own disappears.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s1e9.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":1,"e":10,"n":"Only You","r":46,"y":"Stan follows a thread toward a member of Gregory's network, drawing uncomfortably close to Elizabeth and stirring old resentments between her and Philip.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s1e10.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":1,"e":11,"n":"Covert War","r":42,"y":"News from Moscow hits Elizabeth personally, pushing her toward a risky operation that requires Philip's help and puts them at odds with their handler and the Bureau.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s1e11.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":1,"e":12,"n":"The Oath","r":43,"y":"An informant offers valuable secrets for a price, and the Jennings take escalating chances on a deal that smells like a trap as Stan's investigation gains momentum.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s1e12.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":1,"e":13,"n":"The Colonel","r":48,"y":"Ordered to attend a meeting that may be an ambush, Philip and Elizabeth confront hard truths about their partnership while the FBI tightens its net.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s1e13.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":2,"e":1,"n":"Comrades","r":49,"y":"Back on her feet after an injury, Elizabeth joins a seemingly simple operation that goes badly, leaving the couple fearful for their network and their children.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s2e1.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":2,"e":2,"n":"Cardinal","r":47,"y":"Philip digs into what went wrong on their last job while Elizabeth stays close to home, until a defector at the Soviet embassy creates openings for Nina and Stan.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s2e2.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":2,"e":3,"n":"The Walk In","r":46,"y":"The Jennings push through their next assignment amid complications that worry Philip about Elizabeth's readiness, while Stan earns praise for handling a Soviet defector.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s2e3.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":2,"e":4,"n":"A Little Night Music","r":46,"y":"A familiar face resurfaces just as the couple must cultivate a valuable target, and they take on an unsanctioned side mission that could cost them dearly.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s2e4.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":2,"e":5,"n":"The Deal","r":54,"y":"A new handler arrives as Philip mops up a previous operation and Elizabeth, disguised as Clark's sister, tries to keep Martha calm while Stan searches for a missing scientist.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s2e5.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":2,"e":6,"n":"Behind the Red Door","r":50,"y":"A volatile Navy officer becomes central to the Jennings' latest job and a possible danger to their family, as a Sandinista operative helps Elizabeth reach Capitol Hill.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s2e6.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":2,"e":7,"n":"ARPANET","r":43,"y":"Philip leans on an asset to reach an early computer network the KGB wants to tap, while Nina worries about facing an FBI lie detector test.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s2e7.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":2,"e":8,"n":"New Car","r":50,"y":"Both spies hit painful turns in separate missions, and Stan pursues access to a classified military program that could give him leverage over his Soviet rival.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s2e8.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":2,"e":9,"n":"Martial Eagle","r":50,"y":"A carefully prepared operation turns brutal and affects Philip and Elizabeth in very different ways, while Stan buries himself in work as his home life frays.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s2e9.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":2,"e":10,"n":"Yousaf","r":50,"y":"A mission with global stakes sends Philip back to an asset for help, just as an old adversary returns to Washington looking for payback.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s2e10.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":2,"e":11,"n":"Stealth","r":47,"y":"Philip chases intelligence on American stealth technology while Elizabeth uncovers something unexpected about their handler and Stan keeps hunting for the illegals.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s2e11.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":2,"e":12,"n":"Operation Chronicle","r":45,"y":"With danger closing in, Elizabeth hurries to get Jared out of harm's way as Philip prepares an agent for a key job, and Stan faces an agonizing choice.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s2e12.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":2,"e":13,"n":"Echo","r":49,"y":"In the second-season finale, the Jennings try to protect their children while finishing a critical mission, and Stan holds Nina's fate in his hands.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s2e13.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":3,"e":1,"n":"EST Men","r":48,"y":"Philip and Elizabeth disagree about how to carry out directives from Moscow, and when vital intel slips away, Philip recruits an asset for a delicate job.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s3e1.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":3,"e":2,"n":"Baggage","r":48,"y":"A botched mission forces the couple to work together despite widening ideological differences, as Stan takes charge of a high-profile Soviet defector.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s3e2.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":3,"e":3,"n":"Open House","r":44,"y":"The Jennings move closer to the CIA's Afghan program, Stan keeps tabs on a defector, and tensions rise between FBI agents over a sensitive operation.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s3e3.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":3,"e":4,"n":"Dimebag","r":47,"y":"Developing a new asset presents Philip with a moral quandary, his friction with Elizabeth grows, and Stan forms a theory with serious national-security implications.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s3e4.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":3,"e":5,"n":"Salang Pass","r":45,"y":"Philip juggles the women in his life while Elizabeth resorts to extreme methods to finish an assignment, and Stan teams with an unlikely partner to help Nina.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s3e5.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":3,"e":6,"n":"Born Again","r":49,"y":"Gabriel brings the couple important news, Elizabeth starts steering family matters herself, and Stan leans on Sandra after hearing troubling news from his past.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s3e6.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":3,"e":7,"n":"Walter Taffet","r":47,"y":"A newly shared family secret weighs on Philip and Elizabeth as they pursue KGB interests tied to South Africa, while Stan struggles at work and at home.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s3e7.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":3,"e":8,"n":"Divestment","r":45,"y":"Clark and Martha's marriage faces its hardest test yet, mounting pressure weighs on Philip, and Elizabeth makes a difficult request of Gabriel.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s3e8.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":3,"e":9,"n":"Do Mail Robots Dream of Electric Sheep?","r":45,"y":"The Jennings are assigned to plant a bug inside an FBI mail-delivery robot, while Stan and Oleg cook up a dangerous plan to rescue Nina.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s3e9.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":3,"e":10,"n":"Stingers","r":47,"y":"Philip and Elizabeth put a scheme into motion targeting the CIA's visiting Mujahideen guests, as the atmosphere inside the Jennings household grows increasingly tense.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s3e10.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":3,"e":11,"n":"One Day in the Life of Anton Baklanov","r":44,"y":"The couple's family life and spy work begin to collide dangerously, Nina weighs her options, and Oleg and Tatiana receive an assignment with unclear prospects.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s3e11.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":3,"e":12,"n":"I Am Abassin Zadran","r":45,"y":"Martha receives a surprise visitor, the Jennings must handle a formidable Mujahideen commander, and Paige begins rebelling against her parents.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s3e12.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":3,"e":13,"n":"March 8, 1983","r":50,"y":"Elizabeth takes Paige on a trip that leads into risky territory, Philip seeks comfort after a draining mission, and Stan's effort to save Nina comes to a head.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s3e13.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":4,"e":1,"n":"Glanders","r":51,"y":"The Jennings cope with the consequences of their recent actions as they worry about a pastor's knowledge and take on a perilous bioweapon assignment.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s4e1.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":4,"e":2,"n":"Pastor Tim","r":48,"y":"Philip grows desperate to get rid of a hazardous package while tensions boil over at home when Paige reveals a secret of her own.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s4e2.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":4,"e":3,"n":"Experimental Prototype City of Tomorrow","r":44,"y":"Paige struggles with the weight of knowing her family's secret as Philip and Elizabeth try to protect their cover without harming their daughter.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s4e3.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":4,"e":4,"n":"Chloramphenicol","r":44,"y":"A dangerous slip during an operation forces Philip, Elizabeth, William and Gabriel to reckon with their loyalty and mortality, while Nina takes a risk in Russia.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s4e4.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":4,"e":5,"n":"Clark's Place","r":50,"y":"Philip weighs his double life with Martha and faces a painful decision that could permanently change things for both of them.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s4e5.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":4,"e":6,"n":"The Rat","r":45,"y":"Martha is forced to confront realities she has avoided, while William's latest work makes the Jennings consider what biological warfare would truly mean.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s4e6.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":4,"e":7,"n":"Travel Agents","r":43,"y":"The KGB and the FBI find themselves racing each other to locate a crucial agent, with enormous stakes for everyone involved.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s4e7.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":4,"e":8,"n":"The Magic of David Copperfield V: The Statue of Liberty Disappears","r":51,"y":"Pushed close to their limits, Philip and Elizabeth must handle devoted agents while trying to keep their convictions and their sanity intact.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s4e8.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":4,"e":9,"n":"The Day After","r":46,"y":"A televised nuclear-war film brings Cold War fears into sharp focus as Elizabeth works through a painful, long-running operation involving a woman named Patty.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s4e9.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":4,"e":10,"n":"Munchkins","r":49,"y":"An old mistake of Paige's threatens to resurface and endanger the family, sending her parents scrambling and prompting Paige to rethink who they really are.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s4e10.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":4,"e":11,"n":"Dinner for Seven","r":43,"y":"Elizabeth works through the final stages of an operation that has become deeply personal, uncertain what it will ultimately cost her.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s4e11.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":4,"e":12,"n":"A Roy Rogers in Franconia","r":46,"y":"Paige processes a traumatic experience and begins to see her mother differently, while Oleg's patience with Stan appears to be wearing thin.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s4e12.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":4,"e":13,"n":"Persona Non Grata","r":53,"y":"In the fourth-season finale, the Jennings race the FBI to retrieve a dangerous package as Paige weighs whether to follow her parents' path.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s4e13.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":5,"e":1,"n":"Amber Waves","r":51,"y":"Paige's growing closeness with Stan's son worries the Jennings, while Moscow hands them an operation unlike anything they have attempted, straining their marriage and family.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s5e1.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":5,"e":2,"n":"Pests","r":49,"y":"Stan and Oleg grapple with fallout from their tangled history, while Philip and Elizabeth take on a mission with troubling consequences for the Soviet Union.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s5e2.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":5,"e":3,"n":"The Midges","r":46,"y":"The Jennings let Paige in further on their work, but new questions emerge when an operation takes a grim turn and a package endangers Oleg back home.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s5e3.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":5,"e":4,"n":"What's the Matter with Kansas?","r":46,"y":"Philip and Elizabeth have doubts about a new assignment, a ghost from Philip's past brings unexpected danger, and Stan makes a bold move at the Bureau.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s5e4.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":5,"e":5,"n":"Lotus 1-2-3","r":49,"y":"Unexpected news about Henry reaches the Jennings along with troubling information about an old operation, while Philip grows suspicious of Stan's new romance.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s5e5.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":5,"e":6,"n":"Crossbreed","r":46,"y":"Gabriel makes a surprising announcement and shares unsettling information about Philip's history, as Stan and Aderholt work a new recruit and Oleg begins an anti-corruption probe.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s5e6.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":5,"e":7,"n":"The Committee on Human Rights","r":46,"y":"Paige becomes more entangled in her parents' world, her relationship with Matthew reaches a turning point, and Stan pays for overreaching at the FBI.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s5e7.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":5,"e":8,"n":"Immersion","r":50,"y":"A secret draws Elizabeth and Paige closer, Oleg falls under KGB scrutiny in Moscow, and a development in the Morozov operation opens a surprising opportunity.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s5e8.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":5,"e":9,"n":"IHOP","r":51,"y":"An unexpected turn involving Tuan unsettles Philip and Elizabeth, Henry floats a surprising idea, and Stan has an uncomfortable meeting with a former colleague's widow.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s5e9.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":5,"e":10,"n":"Darkroom","r":49,"y":"Paige's prying pushes her parents toward a choice that could reshape their lives, while Stan and Aderholt's efforts with Sofia start paying off.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s5e10.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":5,"e":11,"n":"Dyatkovo","r":44,"y":"The Jennings are handed an assignment rooted in vengeance, while Stan gives Henry a behind-the-scenes look at the FBI.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s5e11.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":5,"e":12,"n":"The World Council of Churches","r":51,"y":"Philip and Elizabeth wrestle with a major decision, Tuan acts on his own in the Morozov job, and Oleg's investigation runs into Soviet bureaucratic realities.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s5e12.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":5,"e":13,"n":"The Soviet Division","r":58,"y":"In the fifth-season finale, the couple races to save a life while Stan contemplates an uncertain professional future.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s5e13.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":6,"e":1,"n":"Dead Hand","r":56,"y":"In autumn 1987, with a superpower arms summit approaching, Elizabeth is stretched thinner than ever while Philip runs the travel agency until an unexpected visitor arrives.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s6e1.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":6,"e":2,"n":"Tchaikovsky","r":47,"y":"Elizabeth works an old source who could influence the coming summit, Philip handles travel-agency business, and Stan learns a familiar figure has returned.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s6e2.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":6,"e":3,"n":"Urban Transport Planning","r":50,"y":"After a disastrous operation, Philip and Elizabeth argue over how to handle Paige, while Stan tries to manage a defector couple's deteriorating relationship.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s6e3.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":6,"e":4,"n":"Mr. and Mrs. Teacup","r":50,"y":"Armed with alarming intelligence, Elizabeth goes to great lengths to get close to a Soviet arms negotiator, while Philip gives Henry some surprising news.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s6e4.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":6,"e":5,"n":"The Great Patriotic War","r":60,"y":"Elizabeth looks into a Russian official who has been seen meeting with an American intelligence officer.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s6e5.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":6,"e":6,"n":"Rififi","r":47,"y":"An abrupt assignment draws Elizabeth away from home at a critical time, while an FBI development leads Aderholt to bring Stan an urgent case.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s6e6.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":6,"e":7,"n":"Harvest","r":52,"y":"Philip and Elizabeth join forces for a dangerous operation unlike any before, while Stan and Henry spend some time together.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s6e7.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":6,"e":8,"n":"The Summit","r":58,"y":"As the arms summit gets under way, something Philip reveals throws Elizabeth's work into upheaval, and Stan pursues a risky hunch.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s6e8.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":6,"e":9,"n":"Jennings, Elizabeth","r":51,"y":"Elizabeth struggles between competing loyalties while Philip finds himself caught up in an encounter that becomes far more than he expected.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s6e9.jpg"},{"t":"the-americans","s":6,"e":10,"n":"START","r":71,"y":"In the series finale, the Jennings confront a decision that will permanently alter the course of their lives.","p":"/assets/stills/the-americans-s6e10.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":1,"e":1,"n":"I/O","r":48,"y":"In early-1980s Texas, a slick former IBM salesman joins a modest computer company and quickly reveals ambitions far bigger than the job he was hired for.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s1e1.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":1,"e":2,"n":"FUD","r":43,"y":"Having weathered a visit from IBM's lawyers, Joe's group must set aside personal friction and start the demanding engineering work of building a new computer.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s1e2.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":1,"e":3,"n":"High Plains Hardware","r":43,"y":"Gordon and Cameron wrestle with turning Joe's ambitious plan into working hardware, while Joe and Bosworth go looking for the money to build it.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s1e3.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":1,"e":4,"n":"Close to the Metal","r":43,"y":"With Cameron nearly done writing the BIOS, an emergency jeopardizes the whole project and forces the entire team to pitch in to save it.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s1e4.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":1,"e":5,"n":"Adventure","r":43,"y":"Cameron chafes under a newly installed manager, while Joe and Gordon set out to secure a crucial new component for their computer.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s1e5.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":1,"e":6,"n":"Landfall","r":43,"y":"Cameron's breakthrough puts her in conflict with Gordon and forces Joe into a difficult call, as a powerful hurricane brings personal truths to the surface.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s1e6.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":1,"e":7,"n":"Giant","r":43,"y":"Someone from Joe's past shows up and complicates his bond with Cameron, while Gordon, alone with Donna away, starts feeling the strain of overwork.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s1e7.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":1,"e":8,"n":"The 214s","r":43,"y":"A scandal rocks Cardiff Electric as the team readies for the COMDEX trade show, and Bosworth makes a personal sacrifice to protect the PC project.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s1e8.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":1,"e":9,"n":"Up Helly Aa","r":43,"y":"Unexpected competitors and fresh complications threaten to undo the Cardiff Electric team's big showing at COMDEX in Las Vegas.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s1e9.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":1,"e":10,"n":"1984","r":43,"y":"In the first-season finale, Gordon and Joe get ready to ship the Giant, but a suspicious flaw creates a rift in their partnership.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s1e10.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":2,"e":1,"n":"SETI","r":43,"y":"Cameron and Donna's online gaming startup, Mutiny, hits a crucial moment, while Joe and Gordon cross paths once again.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s2e1.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":2,"e":2,"n":"New Coke","r":44,"y":"Joe starts a new job after meeting his fiancée's father, while Gordon struggles with how to fill his unexpected free time.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s2e2.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":2,"e":3,"n":"The Way In","r":44,"y":"Bosworth tries to reconnect with the life he once had, while Gordon and Donna receive an invitation they did not expect.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s2e3.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":2,"e":4,"n":"Play with Friends","r":46,"y":"Joe and Gordon join forces to pursue Joe's latest idea, while friction builds between Cameron and Donna at Mutiny.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s2e4.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":2,"e":5,"n":"Extract and Defend","r":43,"y":"A clash with Joe sends Cameron spiraling, while Gordon tries to come to terms with some difficult personal news.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s2e5.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":2,"e":6,"n":"10Broad36","r":44,"y":"Gordon heads to California hoping to reconnect with his brother, while Joe uses his leverage in a business situation.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s2e6.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":2,"e":7,"n":"Working for the Clampdown","r":44,"y":"Gordon and Donna each keep secrets from the other, while Gordon quietly launches a new business venture.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s2e7.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":2,"e":8,"n":"Limbo","r":43,"y":"At Mutiny's user picnic, Cameron and Tom try to sort out their relationship, while Gordon goes searching for answers.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s2e8.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":2,"e":9,"n":"Kali","r":44,"y":"Blindsided by a competitor's product launch, Mutiny's team scrambles to take steps to ensure the company survives.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s2e9.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":2,"e":10,"n":"Heaven Is a Place","r":46,"y":"In the second-season finale, the Clark family hits a crisis while Gordon steps in to try to help Joe.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s2e10.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":3,"e":1,"n":"Valley of the Heart's Delight","r":44,"y":"Now relocated to California, Donna and Cameron look for ways to grow Mutiny beyond chat, as Gordon settles in and Joe unveils his newest product.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s3e1.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":3,"e":2,"n":"One Way or Another","r":43,"y":"Cameron and Donna struggle to land venture capital, while Joe brings on a key programmer whose departure leaves Mutiny's team stunned.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s3e2.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":3,"e":3,"n":"Flipping the Switch","r":42,"y":"Gordon and Donna's personal life bleeds into the workplace and raises tensions at Mutiny, while Joe sits down with his company's board.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s3e3.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":3,"e":4,"n":"Rules of Honorable Play","r":43,"y":"A laser-tag outing teaches Gordon about teamwork, while Donna and Cameron disagree over a potential acquisition.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s3e4.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":3,"e":5,"n":"Yerba Buena","r":46,"y":"Donna and Gordon opt for a staycation instead of camping, Bos and Cameron travel back to Texas, and Joe and Ryan reach a realization.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s3e5.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":3,"e":6,"n":"And She Was","r":44,"y":"An offer to buy Mutiny stirs tension, Donna spends a weekend on her own, Gordon and Cameron bond over games, and Joe faces off with his board.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s3e6.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":3,"e":7,"n":"The Threshold","r":47,"y":"Joe and Ryan face the fallout from one of Joe's choices, Cameron and Donna argue about the company's direction, and Gordon wrestles with his conscience.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s3e7.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":3,"e":8,"n":"You Are Not Safe","r":47,"y":"Donna, Bos and Diane take Mutiny on the road to drum up support while the rest of the team nervously awaits a pivotal day.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s3e8.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":3,"e":9,"n":"NIM","r":46,"y":"Donna tries to rally old colleagues at COMDEX around her vision of the internet's future, while Gordon contends with his headstrong teenage daughter Joanie.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s3e9.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":3,"e":10,"n":"NeXT","r":50,"y":"In the third-season finale, Donna's ideas spark a lively debate about the next big thing, though the outcome may not please everyone.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s3e10.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":4,"e":1,"n":"So It Goes","r":45,"y":"Gordon enjoys some success while Joe fights to keep their web venture alive, Cameron prolongs a work trip, and Donna kicks off a new endeavor.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s4e1.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":4,"e":2,"n":"Signal to Noise","r":49,"y":"Joe and Cameron reconnect over the phone, Donna elevates her assistant, and Gordon's company buckles under pressure from a bigger rival.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s4e2.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":4,"e":3,"n":"Miscellaneous","r":47,"y":"Cameron promotes her new game at an industry event, Donna confronts familiar rivals, and Gordon has trouble backing Joe's latest idea.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s4e3.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":4,"e":4,"n":"Tonya and Nancy","r":44,"y":"Cameron buys land to find her center, Joe and Gordon hire a team to catalog the web by hand, and Donna rallies her staff.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s4e4.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":4,"e":5,"n":"Nowhere Man","r":46,"y":"Donna grapples with suspicion, Bosworth reaches a breaking point, Joe makes a confession to Gordon, and Cameron confronts old mistakes.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s4e5.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":4,"e":6,"n":"A Connection Is Made","r":50,"y":"Donna courts a major player, Gordon addresses a school problem with his daughter, Cameron gains an admirer, and Joe sees Haley differently.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s4e6.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":4,"e":7,"n":"Who Needs a Guy","r":45,"y":"Joe and Gordon debate the future of their search company, Donna takes time off, Cameron meets a challenging collaborator, and Bos and Diane make a big decision.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s4e7.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":4,"e":8,"n":"Goodwill","r":55,"y":"Cameron helps Donna pack, Bos cooks his signature chili, Joe helps Haley track down a cherished keepsake, and old tensions flare between Gordon and Donna.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s4e8.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":4,"e":9,"n":"Search","r":46,"y":"Donna reaches a career crossroads, Joanie sets out on a trip, Joe reveals a redesign, and Cameron asks a former partner for a favor.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s4e9.jpg"},{"t":"halt-and-catch-fire","s":4,"e":10,"n":"Ten of Swords","r":52,"y":"In the series finale, Donna marks a milestone with her closest friends, while Cameron and Joe each weigh what comes next for them.","p":"/assets/stills/halt-and-catch-fire-s4e10.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":1,"e":1,"n":"Episode 1","r":68,"y":"In 1912, news of a shipwreck leaves the Earl of Grantham's estate without its expected heirs, raising urgent questions about who will inherit Downton Abbey.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s1e1.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":1,"e":2,"n":"Episode 2","r":50,"y":"New heir Matthew Crawley and his mother Isobel arrive and struggle to adjust, while Violet schemes to pair Matthew with Mary and Carson confronts his past.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s1e2.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":1,"e":3,"n":"Episode 3","r":50,"y":"Cora tries to match Mary with a visiting diplomat, but the arrival of his handsome Turkish friend sets events in motion, while Bates seeks a cure for his limp.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s1e3.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":1,"e":4,"n":"Episode 4","r":48,"y":"A former admirer reappears in Mrs Hughes's life and makes her reconsider her future, Violet and Isobel spar over Molesley's health, and Carson suspects a thief.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s1e4.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":1,"e":5,"n":"Episode 5","r":50,"y":"Isobel and Violet butt heads again, Mary meets a new suitor while her heart lies elsewhere, Anna investigates a missing snuff box, and O'Brien helps Edith plot revenge.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s1e5.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":1,"e":6,"n":"Episode 6","r":49,"y":"Sybil's interest in politics leads her into a volatile election count, Matthew's feelings become evident to the sisters, and Bates faces accusations over missing wine.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s1e6.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":1,"e":7,"n":"Episode 7","r":65,"y":"In the first-series finale, unexpected family news reopens the inheritance question as Mary weighs a marriage proposal and O'Brien digs up more about Bates.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s1e7.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":2,"e":1,"n":"Episode 1","r":69,"y":"With the First World War raging in 1916, the family and staff feel its upheaval, while new maid Ethel annoys O'Brien and Bates brings Anna difficult news.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s2e1.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":2,"e":2,"n":"Episode 2","r":56,"y":"Carson struggles to keep household standards amid wartime shortages, and a tragedy at a nearby hospital prompts Isobel to propose a bold new use for Downton.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s2e2.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":2,"e":3,"n":"Episode 3","r":56,"y":"With the house serving as a convalescent home for officers, Matthew brings a general to visit, and the family wonders whether Lavinia has something to hide.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s2e3.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":2,"e":4,"n":"Episode 4","r":55,"y":"Isobel and Cora clash over running the convalescent home, Ethel's flirtation causes trouble, worrying reports arrive about Matthew, and Branson declares himself to Sybil.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s2e4.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":2,"e":5,"n":"Episode 5","r":56,"y":"Robert receives troubling news from the front, Daisy feels rushed in her relationship with William, and Vera threatens to expose old secrets.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s2e5.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":2,"e":6,"n":"Episode 6","r":56,"y":"Sir Richard Carlisle warns Mary against breaking their engagement, a mysterious officer arrives claiming kinship with the family, and Bates learns his divorce plans have stalled.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s2e6.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":2,"e":7,"n":"Episode 7","r":56,"y":"Sybil and Branson struggle to keep their secret, Carlisle puts Anna in an awkward spot, Bates reels from news about Vera, and Thomas starts a new scheme.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s2e7.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":2,"e":8,"n":"Episode 8","r":70,"y":"In the second-series finale, wedding excitement fills the house, but Branson's intentions threaten to unsettle everyone while Anna pushes Bates to think seriously about their future together.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s2e8.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":3,"e":1,"n":"Episode 1","r":69,"y":"In 1920, Cora's American mother arrives for Matthew and Mary's wedding, but strains between the couple threaten the big day as a new footman joins the staff.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s3e1.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":3,"e":2,"n":"Episode 2","r":50,"y":"With the estate's finances in jeopardy, Mary hopes her grandmother Martha will help, while Violet pushes for a lavish party and Mrs Hughes faces a health worry.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s3e2.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":3,"e":3,"n":"Episode 3","r":50,"y":"Edith's wedding day finally arrives as the family debates whether her groom's age truly matters, Anna makes progress helping Bates, and Mary takes initiative.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s3e3.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":3,"e":4,"n":"Episode 4","r":50,"y":"Branson's political activities land him in serious trouble and test Sybil's loyalty, while Ethel agonizes over her son's future and Anna worries about Bates's silence.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s3e4.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":3,"e":5,"n":"Episode 5","r":50,"y":"An intriguing offer for Edith divides the household, Isobel extends a helping hand to Ethel, and new kitchen maid Ivy draws plenty of attention below stairs.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s3e5.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":3,"e":6,"n":"Episode 6","r":50,"y":"An act of kindness by Isobel stirs controversy, Mary defends Branson's choices, and Violet tries to help Robert and Cora as their marriage feels the strain.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s3e6.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":3,"e":7,"n":"Episode 7","r":50,"y":"Edith receives admiration from an unexpected admirer, Matthew presses his case on estate management, and Branson's christening plans and a surprise visitor cause a stir.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s3e7.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":3,"e":8,"n":"Episode 8","r":69,"y":"In the third-series finale, the annual village cricket match brings out Robert's competitive streak, while Violet's lively great-niece Rose arrives with more going on than she lets on.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s3e8.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":4,"e":1,"n":"Episode 1","r":69,"y":"Months after a devastating loss, Mary is consumed by grief while Robert and Violet disagree over how to help her, and Carson hears from his past.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s4e1.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":4,"e":2,"n":"Episode 2","r":50,"y":"Mary starts taking an interest in running the estate, Lady Rose lands in a predicament at a York dance, and Mrs Hughes urges Carson to mend an old rift.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s4e2.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":4,"e":3,"n":"Episode 3","r":50,"y":"A grand house party gathers old friends and new guests at Downton, bringing music and celebration but also mischief and heartache above and below stairs.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s4e3.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":4,"e":4,"n":"Episode 4","r":50,"y":"Amid the aftermath of the house party, Mary weighs a question about her future, Carson shares surprising details of his past, and Rose risks scandal in London.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s4e4.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":4,"e":5,"n":"Episode 5","r":49,"y":"An opportunity for Alfred unsettles Ivy and Daisy, Isobel appeals to Violet's charity, and Branson contemplates a new life for himself and his daughter.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s4e5.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":4,"e":6,"n":"Episode 6","r":50,"y":"A birthday celebration for Robert is shaken up by Rose's surprise contribution, a farming venture brings drama for Mary, and Edith receives more worrying news.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s4e6.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":4,"e":7,"n":"Episode 7","r":50,"y":"Robert travels to America to help Cora's brother out of trouble, while Mary and Blake set aside their differences to tackle an estate matter and Violet falls ill.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s4e7.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":4,"e":8,"n":"Episode 8","r":70,"y":"In the fourth-series finale, Rosamund devises a plan to help Edith with a delicate problem, Isobel attracts an admirer, and Mary asks Gillingham for a favor.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s4e8.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":5,"e":1,"n":"Episode 1","r":69,"y":"In 1924, a new Labour government signals social change across Britain, and a proposed war memorial puts Carson at odds with Robert and Mrs Hughes.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s5e1.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":5,"e":2,"n":"Episode 2","r":50,"y":"The household recovers from a dramatic night as Robert faces a hard decision, Daisy struggles with her studies, and Thomas sets his sights on Baxter.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s5e2.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":5,"e":3,"n":"Episode 3","r":50,"y":"Mary's secret rendezvous nearly comes to light, Robert is embarrassed when plans go awry, and the circumstances of an old death come under renewed scrutiny.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s5e3.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":5,"e":4,"n":"Episode 4","r":50,"y":"Schoolteacher Sarah Bunting stirs things up above stairs once more, Thomas returns unwell with a mysterious ailment, and Violet confides a secret to Isobel.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s5e4.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":5,"e":5,"n":"Episode 5","r":50,"y":"Art historian Simon Bricker returns to discuss a painting with Cora, Branson makes a decision about Sarah Bunting, and Rose meets a charming stranger.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s5e5.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":5,"e":6,"n":"Episode 6","r":50,"y":"Robert and Cora's marriage remains strained, Mary finds herself facing a romantic rival, and Edith hears devastating news that prompts her to take drastic action.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s5e6.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":5,"e":7,"n":"Episode 7","r":50,"y":"Rosamund comes to Downton after Edith suddenly leaves, Rose introduces Atticus and his parents to the family, and Anna and Bates contemplate a fresh start.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s5e7.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":5,"e":8,"n":"Episode 8","r":70,"y":"In the fifth-series finale, preparations for Rose's wedding are tested by family friction on both sides, while Edith and Cora try to keep a secret from Robert.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s5e8.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":6,"e":1,"n":"Episode 1","r":69,"y":"In 1925, hidden secrets and family rifts threaten the Crawleys' unity, while the staff below stairs face the pressures of a changing society.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s6e1.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":6,"e":2,"n":"Episode 2","r":50,"y":"Mary's interference lands Carson in trouble with Mrs Hughes, Cora and Violet spar over the hospital merger, and Robert faces a difficult decision.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s6e2.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":6,"e":3,"n":"Episode 3","r":50,"y":"Plans for Carson and Mrs Hughes's wedding gather pace, Edith reconnects with an old acquaintance, and Violet's butler Spratt is concealing something.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s6e3.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":6,"e":4,"n":"Episode 4","r":50,"y":"Tom and Sybbie settle back in at Downton, and both family and staff are surprised when another familiar face reappears under unusual circumstances.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s6e4.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":6,"e":5,"n":"Episode 5","r":50,"y":"The Minister of Health comes to dinner and is pulled into Violet's campaign to protect the hospital, while Andy helps Mr Mason settle into a farm.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s6e5.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":6,"e":6,"n":"Episode 6","r":50,"y":"Downton opens its doors to paying visitors to raise funds for the hospital, splitting opinion among family and servants as the hospital dispute heats up.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s6e6.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":6,"e":7,"n":"Episode 7","r":50,"y":"The family attends a motor race to watch Henry compete, Violet hatches a surprising plan, and Molesley and Daisy rise to new challenges.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s6e7.jpg"},{"t":"downton-abbey","s":6,"e":8,"n":"Episode 8","r":76,"y":"In the final regular episode, Edith wrestles with whether to reveal her past to Bertie, while Mary's feud with her sister escalates toward a breaking point.","p":"/assets/stills/downton-abbey-s6e8.jpg"},{"t":"shogun","s":1,"e":1,"n":"Anjin","r":71,"y":"In 1600 Japan, an English navigator's battered ship drifts into a fishing village just as the powerful Lord Toranaga finds himself cornered by rival regents in Osaka.","p":"/assets/stills/shogun-s1e1.jpg"},{"t":"shogun","s":1,"e":2,"n":"Servants of Two Masters","r":60,"y":"The foreign pilot's arrival in Osaka stirs political rivalries, and Christian noblewoman Mariko is torn between duty and faith when assigned to translate for him.","p":"/assets/stills/shogun-s1e2.jpg"},{"t":"shogun","s":1,"e":3,"n":"Tomorrow Is Tomorrow","r":54,"y":"After Blackthorne survives a bold attempt on his life, Toranaga realizes he must get his allies out of Osaka before his enemies close in.","p":"/assets/stills/shogun-s1e3.jpg"},{"t":"shogun","s":1,"e":4,"n":"The Eightfold Fence","r":58,"y":"Blackthorne and Mariko put their uneasy alliance to work training Toranaga's musket regiment, while Yabushige juggles prior promises when an old acquaintance visits.","p":"/assets/stills/shogun-s1e4.jpg"},{"t":"shogun","s":1,"e":5,"n":"Broken to the Fist","r":58,"y":"Blackthorne and Mariko struggle to keep a dangerous secret hidden, while Yabushige hunts for the informant who exposed his schemes to Toranaga.","p":"/assets/stills/shogun-s1e5.jpg"},{"t":"shogun","s":1,"e":6,"n":"Ladies of the Willow World","r":58,"y":"Lady Ochiba returns to Osaka to speed up the regents' campaign against Toranaga, while in Ajiro, Toranaga puts Mariko's loyalty to the test.","p":"/assets/stills/shogun-s1e6.jpg"},{"t":"shogun","s":1,"e":7,"n":"A Stick of Time","r":56,"y":"Outmaneuvered by shifting alliances in Osaka, Toranaga is forced to negotiate a new arrangement with an estranged relative.","p":"/assets/stills/shogun-s1e7.jpg"},{"t":"shogun","s":1,"e":8,"n":"The Abyss of Life","r":59,"y":"Toranaga's weakened clan relocates to Edo to await its fate, and Blackthorne must choose between loyalty to his lord and his original reasons for coming to Japan.","p":"/assets/stills/shogun-s1e8.jpg"},{"t":"shogun","s":1,"e":9,"n":"Crimson Sky","r":62,"y":"Mariko travels to Osaka to face the most consequential challenge of her life, while Blackthorne and Yabushige scramble as their options dwindle.","p":"/assets/stills/shogun-s1e9.jpg"},{"t":"shogun","s":1,"e":10,"n":"A Dream of a Dream","r":63,"y":"In the season finale, Blackthorne reflects on recent events and begins to grasp the true scope of Toranaga's long game.","p":"/assets/stills/shogun-s1e10.jpg"},{"t":"the-night-of","s":1,"e":1,"n":"Part 1: The Beach","r":79,"y":"A shy Pakistani-American college student from Queens borrows his father's taxi for a party, and an encounter with a mysterious young woman turns into a night of chaos.","p":"/assets/stills/the-night-of-s1e1.jpg"},{"t":"the-night-of","s":1,"e":2,"n":"Part 2: Subtle Beast","r":60,"y":"Small-time defense attorney John Stone takes an interest in Naz's case, while seasoned detective Dennis Box methodically builds the investigation.","p":"/assets/stills/the-night-of-s1e2.jpg"},{"t":"the-night-of","s":1,"e":3,"n":"Part 3: A Dark Crate","r":60,"y":"While awaiting arraignment at Rikers Island, Naz learns that his safety may depend on a powerful and influential inmate named Freddy.","p":"/assets/stills/the-night-of-s1e3.jpg"},{"t":"the-night-of","s":1,"e":4,"n":"Part 4: The Art of War","r":60,"y":"Stone digs for details about the crime and the people connected to it as he tries to build a defense for Naz.","p":"/assets/stills/the-night-of-s1e4.jpg"},{"t":"the-night-of","s":1,"e":5,"n":"Part 5: The Season of the Witch","r":60,"y":"Detective Box retraces Naz's movements throughout the night in question, piecing together a timeline of everything that happened.","p":"/assets/stills/the-night-of-s1e5.jpg"},{"t":"the-night-of","s":1,"e":6,"n":"Part 6: Samson and Delilah","r":58,"y":"As prosecutor Helen Weiss readies her case for trial, Naz grows closer to Freddy and adapts to life inside Rikers.","p":"/assets/stills/the-night-of-s1e6.jpg"},{"t":"the-night-of","s":1,"e":7,"n":"Part 7: Ordinary Death","r":57,"y":"The trial of Nasir Khan shifts to the defense's turn to present its case, with Stone and his colleagues working to sway the jury.","p":"/assets/stills/the-night-of-s1e7.jpg"},{"t":"the-night-of","s":1,"e":8,"n":"Part 8: The Call of the Wild","r":96,"y":"In the series finale, a controversy over the defense thrusts Stone into the spotlight as Naz's trial approaches its conclusion.","p":"/assets/stills/the-night-of-s1e8.jpg"}]$json$::jsonb)
